            "special_values": null,
            "values": [
                "<p style=\"font-size: 1.5em\">Tenovi Pillbox Expectations</p>\n<p>These variables will be used to assess <span style=\"color: red;\"><b>medical adherence</b></span>.</p>  \n<p>It is recommended to <b>monitor only medications of interest</b> for stroke rehabilitation and prevention.</p> \n<ul>\n  <li>If possible, for a higher accuracy, split in AM and PM openings.</li>    \n  <li>If not, use a \u2018daily total\u2019 number of openings, and leave the numbers of AM and PM openings blank.</li> \n</ul>"
            ],
